        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "http://www.jackpot-films.com",
          "overview": "Amid the barren landscape of post-famine Ireland, a father and daughter struggle to survive the brutal winter as caretakers of a remote mansion, only to be driven to the edge of sanity by the horrors lurking within.",
